  "content": {
    "title": "省高校毕业生就业指导中心党总支开展“爱护环境•从我做起”主题党日活动",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2019-02-28",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">2月28日，省高校毕业生就业指导中心党总支开展“爱护环境·从我做起”主题党日活动。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">此次活动是中心党总支联合临河街道浦东社区开展的一次“红飘带”志愿者活动。中心党总支全体党员和浦东社区工作人员一起到“鲇鱼沟”进行垃圾清理工作。大家手持清理夹、垃圾袋，从海口花园出发，沿线穿过金川街、深圳街，一直至仙台大街，对“鲇鱼沟”全线的白色垃圾进行了全面清理。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><w:LatentStyles DefLockedState=\"false\"  DefUnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"  DefSemiHidden=\"true\"  DefQFormat=\"false\"  DefPriority=\"99\"  LatentStyleCount=\"260\" >\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"Normal\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"9